{"title":"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 18","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The set of all real numbers for which \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/f/14fbbf1d306af9fed15519af602e8092a4b49982.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x+\\sqrt{x^2+1}-\\frac{1}{x+\\sqrt{x^2+1}}\\]\" width=\"218\" height=\"41\" />\nis a rational number is the set of all\n</p><p>(A) integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />  (B) rational <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />  (C) real <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />\n</p><p>(D) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/2/9822d3afa95d5e196bc0dff4aacd09aa101e8e62.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{x^2+1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"64\" height=\"18\" /> is rational\n</p><p>(E) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/2/4f22575584f7a260003326f7b5c817eaa931b1b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+\\sqrt{x^2+1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"97\" height=\"18\" /> is rational\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Rationalizing the denominator of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/7/13729d2dfd54d80f0dfa5cc6709c80555ec5bc30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{x+\\sqrt{x^2+1}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"99\" height=\"41\" />, it simplifies: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/7/13729d2dfd54d80f0dfa5cc6709c80555ec5bc30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{x+\\sqrt{x^2+1}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"99\" height=\"41\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/6/4a65a5481246c96eae90222468ce62d9d8888d48.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x-\\sqrt{x^2+1}}{x^2-(x^2+1)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"105\" height=\"45\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/e/a8ed18238ec06eae6afbc55b83cec0b62aee5139.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x-\\sqrt{x^2+1}}{-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"103\" height=\"44\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/9/bf9eb79e9f4486fd06bf7b82fea739808ca2a044.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-(x-\\sqrt{x^2+1})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"123\" height=\"21\" />. Substituting this into the original equation, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/4/0d4cbaaf96a7b4c7bf45652f30c59b6bd0faa220.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + \\sqrt{x^2+1} - (-(x-\\sqrt{x^2+1})) = x+\\sqrt{x^2+1} + x - \\sqrt{x^2+1} = 2x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"542\" height=\"21\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/c/2ec701493fa72dda5d6747fe14f30e7b1c2fb6c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" /> is only rational if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is rational <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/5/fd5cf5dbc8229738cf06adbf2aa73fd75994b058.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(B)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"25\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME\" title=\"1989 AHSME\">1989 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1989 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1989\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-a